---
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<section id="crea-tu-sistema-bow" class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#4928C2]/50 bg-[#0B0D12] p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(4,6,7,0.85)]">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Left: Inbound Preview Form -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-emerald-400 uppercase">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>SOLICITUD SIN CARGO · ENTREGA EN &lt; 24 HORAS</span>
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-outfit text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#F8F6FF] sm:text-4xl">
          CREÁ TU SISTEMA BOW: <span class="text-[#BF40FA]">Pedí tu preview gratuita en vivo</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/90">
          Completá los datos de tu consultorio o estudio. Registramos tu pedido, te confirmamos por email y te armamos una muestra interactiva con 4 estilos de color en menos de 24 horas, sin costo ni compromiso.
        </p>

        <!-- Formulario Inbound 0-JS -->
        <form
          action="/api/v1/bow-system/create"
          method="POST"
          class="mt-8 space-y-5 border-t border-[#4928C2]/30 pt-6"
        >
          <!-- Campo antispam oculto (honeypot) -->
          <div class="hidden" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="lead-website-confirm">Dejá este campo vacío</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="lead-website-confirm"
              name="website_confirm"
              value=""
              tabindex="-1"
              autocomplete="off"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <label for="lead-nombre" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC] mb-1.5">
                Nombre y Apellido *
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="lead-nombre"
                name="name"
                required
                placeholder="Ej: Dra. Sofía Martínez"
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/45 bg-[#040607] px-4 py-3 text-base text-[#F8F6FF] placeholder-[#E3D9FC]/55 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="lead-rubro" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC] mb-1.5">
                Especialidad o Rubro *
              </label>
              <select
                id="lead-rubro"
                name="rubro"
                required
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/45 bg-[#040607] px-4 py-3 text-base text-[#F8F6FF] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
              >
                <option value="Medicina Estética & Dermatología">Medicina Estética &amp; Dermatología</option>
                <option value="Odontología & Estética Dental">Odontología &amp; Estética Dental</option>
                <option value="Cirugía Plástica & Reparadora">Cirugía Plástica &amp; Reparadora</option>
                <option value="Nutrición Funcional & Deportiva">Nutrición Funcional &amp; Deportiva</option>
                <option value="Estudio Jurídico & Abogacía">Estudio Jurídico &amp; Abogacía</option>
                <option value="Kinesiología & Alto Rendimiento">Kinesiología &amp; Alto Rendimiento</option>
                <option value="Clínica / Centro Médico">Clínica / Centro Médico</option>
                <option value="Otro Servicio Profesional">Otro Servicio Profesional</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="lead-maps" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC] mb-1.5">
              Link de Google Maps, Instagram o Web actual
            </label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="lead-maps"
              name="maps_url"
              placeholder="https://maps.app.goo.gl/... o @tu_consultorio"
              class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/45 bg-[#040607] px-4 py-3 text-base text-[#F8F6FF] placeholder-[#E3D9FC]/55 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <label for="lead-whatsapp" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC] mb-1.5">
                WhatsApp de Contacto *
              </label>
              <input
                type="tel"
                id="lead-whatsapp"
                name="whatsapp"
                required
                placeholder="+54 9 11 1234-5678"
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/45 bg-[#040607] px-4 py-3 text-base text-[#F8F6FF] placeholder-[#E3D9FC]/55 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="lead-email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC] mb-1.5">
                Email para recibir la muestra *
              </label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="lead-email"
                name="email"
                required
                placeholder="doctora@tudominio.com"
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/45 bg-[#040607] px-4 py-3 text-base text-[#F8F6FF] placeholder-[#E3D9FC]/55 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 pt-1">
            <input
              type="checkbox"
              id="lead-accept-terms"
              name="accept_terms"
              value="true"
              required
              class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded border border-[#4928C2]/70 bg-[#040607] accent-[#BF40FA] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#BF40FA]"
            />
            <label for="lead-accept-terms" class="cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]">
              Leí y acepto los{" "}
              <a
                href="/terminos/"
                class="font-semibold text-[#F8F6FF] underline decoration-[#BF40FA] underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#BF40FA] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#BF40FA]"
              >
                Términos y Condiciones
              </a>{" "}
              y la{" "}
              <a
                href="/privacidad/"
                class="font-semibold text-[#F8F6FF] underline decoration-[#BF40FA] underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#BF40FA] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#BF40FA]"
              >
                Política de Privacidad
              </a>{" "}
              de NexoBow. *
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2">
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#BF40FA] px-6 py-4 text-base font-extrabold text-[#040607] transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-[#D170FF] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#F8F6FF]"
            >
              <span>Pedir mi muestra gratuita</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-[#E3D9FC]/80">
          <span>🔒 Cero spam · Cumplimiento Ley 25.326</span>
          <a
            href={SITE.whatsappUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-bold text-emerald-400 hover:underline"
          >
            ¿Preferís pedirla por WhatsApp directo? {SITE.phone} →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Clear 3-Step Visual Summary (no dense JSON jargon) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6 border-t border-[#4928C2]/30 pt-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:border-[#4928C2]/30 lg:pt-0 lg:pl-10">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">Qué recibís en menos de 24 horas</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-outfit text-2xl font-bold text-[#F8F6FF]">
            Así preparamos tu muestra sin costo
          </h3>
        </div>

        <ol class="space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#4928C2]/60 bg-[#040607] font-outfit text-sm font-extrabold text-[#E3D9FC]">
              1
            </span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-outfit text-base font-bold text-[#F8F6FF]">Diseño pensado para tu especialidad</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#E3D9FC]/85">Tomamos tus datos públicos y reseñas reales de Google Maps.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#4928C2]/60 bg-[#040607] font-outfit text-sm font-extrabold text-[#E3D9FC]">
              2
            </span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-outfit text-base font-bold text-[#F8F6FF]">4 combinaciones de color en vivo</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#E3D9FC]/85">Probás estilos desde el celular y elegís el que mejor representa tu consultorio.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-emerald-400/60 bg-[#040607] font-outfit text-sm font-extrabold text-emerald-300">
              3
            </span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-outfit text-base font-bold text-[#F8F6FF]">Entrega directa por WhatsApp y correo</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#E3D9FC]/85">Queda reservada 7 días en preview.nexobow.site para que la evalúes tranquilo.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="border-t border-[#4928C2]/25 pt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/85">
          <p class="font-bold text-emerald-300">Atención directa del fundador</p>
          <p class="mt-1">
            Cada pedido lo revisa personalmente <strong>Juanma Merodio</strong> ({SITE.phone}).
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#E3D9FC]/60">
            Registro seguro vía /api/v1/bow-system/create
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
